{"id":"695300958","kind":"article","title":"Gray：自我教育的时间成本很高","author":"Peter Gray","original_authors":["Peter Gray"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Gray:_Self-education_carries_a_high_cost_in_time"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"学校教育问题","date":"2024-05-06","updated":"2024-05-06","votes":78,"comment_count":5,"minutes":1,"chars":501,"keywords":["自主教育","儿童发展","自由玩耍","瑟谷学校","学习动机"],"summary":"Peter Gray 指出，自我教育需要大量不受权威安排的自由时间，让儿童通过玩耍、交友、思考和探索发展兴趣与能力；他以狩猎采集社会和瑟谷学校为例，说明成人应为年轻人留出这类空间。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/695300958","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"myDQmTDy\">基于玩耍和探索的自我教育，需要大量自由时间——做任何想做的事的时间，没有权威者施加压力、决断或侵犯。这些时间会用来交友、琢磨想法或材料、梳理、感受无聊并克服无聊，发展激情。在狩猎采集游群里，成年人对儿童和青少年的要求很少，因为他们明白，年轻人需要自我探索玩耍，才能成为可靠的成年人。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Sudbury_Valley_School\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">瑟谷学校</a>也是如此。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"AntsUmSe\">引用的摘录来自以下<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/References\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">参考资料</a>：</p><p data-pid=\"9qdpkXbR\">作者：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Peter_Gray\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Peter Gray（彼得 · 格雷）</a>博士</p><p data-pid=\"LaADRM4l\">标题：<b>儿童自我教育的天然环境</b><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></p><p data-pid=\"-59GfgQR\">链接：<a class=\"external\" href=\"http://www.psychologytoday.com/blog/freedom-learn/200809/the-natural-environment-children-s-self-education\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">http://www.</span><span class=\"visible\">psychologytoday.com/blo</span><span class=\"invisible\">g/freedom-learn/200809/the-natural-environment-children-s-self-education</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"9PJdUqUD\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 GPT-4，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Gray:_Self-education_carries_a_high_cost_in_time\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gray: Self-education carries a high cost in time - supermemo.guru</a><br/>本<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/References\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">参考资料</a>用于注释《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Problem_of_Schooling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我永远不会送我的孩子去学校</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>》（2017）作者：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Piotr_Wozniak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">彼得·沃兹尼亚克</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 美国儿童自我教育的天然环境 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"618461052\" href=\"#/post/618461052\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 学校教育的问题 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"611469462\" href=\"#/post/611469462\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"303204832\" href=\"#/post/303204832\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"695615857","title":"学科教学知识","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":43,"minutes":4,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 学校教育问题"},{"id":"697517662","title":"强迫学校教育是一个失败的实验","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":49,"minutes":5,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 学校教育问题"},{"id":"611469462","title":"学校教育的问题","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":446,"minutes":10,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"303204832","title":"彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":70,"minutes":9,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"648372165","title":"彼得·格雷（Peter Gray）","autho